Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.00,Default,Ana,0,0,0,,Morning on the Saltmere breakwater.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:03.20,0:00:05.80,Default,Ana,0,0,0,,The ferry leaves at seven,\Nas it has for forty years.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:06.00,0:00:08.00,Sound,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}[gulls calling]
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:08.20,0:00:11.00,Default,Ben,0,0,0,,Tide's turning. We should check\Nthe mooring buoys.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:11.20,0:00:14.00,Default,Ana,0,0,0,,The lighthouse keeper logs\Nevery boat that passes.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.20,0:00:16.50,Sound,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}♪ brass band playing ♪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.80,0:00:19.50,Default,Ben,0,0,0,,Harbour office, this is the pilot launch.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:19.70,0:00:22.00,Default,Ana,0,0,0,,Fog rolls in from the outer mole by noon.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:22.20,0:00:25.00,Default,Ben,0,0,0,,Keep to the marked channel\Npast the red buoy.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:25.20,0:00:28.00,Default,Ana,0,0,0,,By evening the quay is quiet again.
Comment: Marked=0,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,end of the reel
